OL,3,GNEWSATown to lift restriction on
OL,4,Anight-time businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey town is set to end a
OL,7,Frestriction on new night-time
OL,8,Fbusinesses, with the council saying the
OL,9,Fway people go out has changed.
OL,11,FWoking Borough Council currently has in
OL,12,Fplace a "saturation zone", which allows
OL,13,Fit to refuse new licences in parts of
OL,14,Fthe town centre.
OL,16,FBut it has now recommended getting rid
OL,17,Fof the restriction, which typically
OL,18,Fautomatically refuses applications from
OL,19,Fpremises selling alcohol, late-night
OL,20,Ftakeaways, music and sports venues.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
